                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "31669887-23f3-4231-a977-fa1dbbde9cb1",
                                "sense_id": "d0216b79-b2c5-31a7-bded-dee11559defc",
                                "text": "This is a ſlight vnmeritable man, / Meet to be ſent on Errands : is it fit / The three-fold VVorld diuided, he ſhould ſtand / One of the three to ſhare it?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cf7f76a6-56ef-48fd-b7f4-5e642c84e620",
                                "sense_id": "d0216b79-b2c5-31a7-bded-dee11559defc",
                                "text": "The effect of this conſideration ought to be, […] that you give God moſt hearty and ſuperexalted thanks, vvith all the tranſports and raviſhments of ſpirit, for ſo unſpeakable, ſo unmeritable, ſo unrevvardable a loving kindneſs."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6d66bf26-c4e0-4b37-92f4-3cdbaf6eb885",
                                "sense_id": "d0216b79-b2c5-31a7-bded-dee11559defc",
                                "text": "[A]nd Wordsworth, it may be confessed, was liable to failure […] with a result sometimes merely trivial and unmeritable, sometimes actually repulsive or oppressive."
                            }
